        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AI-A7, Traditional Scroll Lever with Contoured Radius Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic look of Fusion Hardware's Contoured Radius Rose with Scroll Lever is great for traditional as well as modern style homes. This solid brass leverset can be transformed just by selecting one of the 5 finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AI-A7 Scroll Lever and Contoured Radius Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Traditional Door Lever Fusion AI A7:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length:  3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection:  1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter:  2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Scroll Lever With Contoured Radius Rose, Fusion AI-A7",
                "description": "Fusion AI-A7, Traditional Scroll Lever with Contoured Radius Rose - The classic look of Fusion Hardware's Contoured Radius Rose with Scroll Lever is great for traditional as well as modern style homes. This solid brass leverset can be transformed just by selecting one of the 5 finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
